  m_text: This tactical style focuses on slowing the pace of battle and disrupting
    the enemy's flow. The goal is survival, not victory. Troops maintain formation
    and avoid risky engagements. There's no intention of counterattacking, and the
    entire force focuses on self-defense. Units at high risk of injury are positioned
    in the rear, and protective units act as a shield. Movement is minimized, and
    magic, healing, and defensive skills are prioritized.
